    <desc json:array="true" language="en-US">&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;History description 2014-03-26: &lt;/b&gt;Lock all vaue sets untouched since 2014-03-26 to trackingId 2014T1_2014_03_26&lt;/p&gt; &lt;b&gt;description: &lt;/b&gt; &lt;p&gt;A relationship that is based on mutual behavior of the two Entities as being related. The basis of such relationship may be agreements (e.g., spouses, contract parties) or they may be &lt;i&gt;de facto&lt;/i&gt; behavior (e.g.
                    friends) or may be an incidental involvement with each other (e.g. parties over a dispute, siblings, children).&lt;/p&gt;</desc>
